<style>
.article-eyebrow-band {
      max-width: 880px; margin: var(--s-7) auto 0; padding: 0 var(--s-5);
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: var(--s-4);
    }
    .article-eyebrow-band__label {
      font-family: var(--sans); font-weight: 700; font-size: var(--t-md);
      letter-spacing: .18em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--ink);
    }
    .article-eyebrow-band__pager { display: inline-flex; gap: var(--s-2); }
    .article-wrap {
      max-width: 880px; margin: var(--s-4) auto var(--s-8);
      background: var(--beginning);
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      padding: var(--s-7) var(--s-7) var(--s-6);
    }
    @media (max-width: 720px) { .article-wrap { padding: var(--s-5); margin-inline: var(--s-3); } }
    .article-back { color: var(--ink-muted); text-decoration: none; font-size: 14px; display: inline-flex; gap: 6px; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 16px; }
    .article-back:hover { color: var(--ink); }
    .article-actions {
      display: flex; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 24px;
    }
    .article-actions button {
      min-height: 38px; border: 0; border-radius: 8px; cursor: pointer;
      background: var(--rose-700); color: var(--snow); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500;
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 6px;
      padding: 6px 14px;
    }
    .article-actions button .ph { font-size: 18px; }
    .article-actions button[data-share] { background: var(--garden); }
    .article-actions button.is-bookmarked { background: var(--rose); }
    .article-eyebrow { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .25em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--rose-700); margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .article-title { font-family: var(--serif); font-weight: 600; font-size: clamp(36px, 5vw, 56px); margin: 0 0 12px; line-height: 1.05; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--pillar); }
    .article-byline { color: var(--ink-muted); font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 32px; }
    .article-hero {
      width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 16/9;
      border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden;
      margin-bottom: 32px;
      background: linear-gradient(rgba(139,80,68,.4), rgba(139,80,68,.5)),
                  url("once-upon-a-time-assets/landing/jazz-hero.jpg") center/cover no-repeat;
      background-blend-mode: multiply, normal;
    }
    .article-body p { font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--ink); margin: 0 0 1em; }
    .article-body p:first-child::first-letter { font-family: var(--serif); float: left; font-size: 56px; line-height: .9; padding: 4px 8px 0 0; color: var(--rose-700); }
    .article-body h2 { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 28px; margin: 32px 0 12px; color: var(--pillar); text-transform: uppercase; }
    .article-body img { width: 100%; border-radius: 12px; margin: 24px 0; }
    .article-body blockquote {
      border-left: 3px solid var(--rose);
      background: var(--rose-50);
      padding: var(--s-5) var(--s-5) var(--s-5) var(--s-6);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      position: relative;
      font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 22px; color: var(--rose-700); font-style: italic;
      margin: 24px 0;
    }
    .article-body blockquote::before {
      content: '\201C';
      font-family: var(--serif);
      font-size: 64px;
      color: var(--rose-300);
      position: absolute;
      top: -8px;
      left: 12px;
      line-height: 1;
    }

    .article-share {
      margin-top: 48px; padding-top: 32px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
      text-align: center;
    }
    .article-share p { font-size: 14px; color: var(--ink-muted); margin-bottom: 12px; }
    .article-share-buttons { display: inline-flex; gap: 10px; }

    .article-related { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 48px 24px 80px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
    .article-related h3 { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 24px; margin: 0 0 24px; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--pillar); text-align: center; }
    .article-related-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 20px; }
    @media (max-width: 720px) { .article-related-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
</style>

<div class="article-eyebrow-band">
      <span class="article-eyebrow-band__label">Current newsletter</span>
      <span class="article-eyebrow-band__pager">
        <a class="btn btn--sm btn--outline" href="newsletter.html"><i class="ph ph-caret-left" aria-hidden="true"></i> Previous Page</a>
        <a class="btn btn--sm" href="newsletter.html">Next Page <i class="ph ph-caret-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></a>
      </span>
    </div>
    <article class="article-wrap">
      <a class="article-back" href="newsletter.html"><i class="ph ph-arrow-left"></i> All newsletters</a>
      <div class="article-actions">
        <button type="button" aria-label="Save article" aria-pressed="false" data-bookmark="newsletter:december-2025"><i class="ph ph-bookmark-simple"></i> <span>Save</span></button>
        <button type="button" aria-label="Share article" data-share data-share-title="December 2025 — Once Upon A Time"><i class="ph ph-share-network"></i> <span>Share</span></button>
        <button type="button" aria-label="Print" data-print><i class="ph ph-printer"></i> <span>Print</span></button>
      </div>
      <div class="article-eyebrow">December 2025</div>
      <h1 class="article-title">Once Upon A Time</h1>
      <p class="article-byline">Written by Sydney Phelps · Published Jan 18, 2026 · 8 min read</p>
      <div class="article-hero" role="img" aria-label="Students performing"></div>
      <div class="article-body">
        <p>This December marked the close of our most ambitious year yet — across nine programs, we welcomed more than 100 children into the studio for arts education that meets them where they are.</p>
        <p>The end of year showcase brought 200+ family members into Studio Room A for a one-night-only celebration of the work our students put in over the season. From beginner ballet to advanced jazz, every track had a moment to shine.</p>
        <h2>Community Garden</h2>
        <p>Our gardening track expanded this year to include weekly trips to the Queens Botanical Garden. Students planted, harvested, and learned to care for native species — bringing home cherry tomatoes by the bagful in late summer.</p>
        <blockquote>“The classes turned my Saturday mornings into the best part of my week.” — Jane, 16</blockquote>
        <h2>Volunteer Spotlight</h2>
        <p>Lena Stuart joined as a volunteer in October and has already chaperoned three field trips, captured photo coverage for two showcases, and helped Mia Kim run the Jazz Dance warm-ups every Thursday.</p>
        <p>Lena's day job is at the Pepsi-Cola plant in Long Island City, but her evenings have been a steady source of generosity for our after-school programs.</p>
        <h2>Looking Ahead</h2>
        <p>Spring 2026 enrollment opens this week. We've added a new Acting track on Tuesdays and a sibling-discount tier for families enrolling two or more children. <a href="enrollment.html?class=seasonal-camps">Reserve a spot <i class="ph ph-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></a></p>
      </div>
      <div class="article-share">
        <p>Share this newsletter</p>
        <div class="article-share-buttons">
          <button type="button" class="article-actions__btn" data-share data-share-title="OUAT December 2025" aria-label="Copy link" style="background:var(--garden);color:var(--snow);border:0;width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer"><i class="ph ph-link"></i></button>
          <a href="https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=OUAT%20December%202025%20Newsletter&url=https://jerickevans-gif.github.io/Once-Upon-A-Time/newsletter-article.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Share on Twitter" style="background:var(--snow);border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--ink);width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:8px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-decoration:none"><i class="ph ph-twitter-logo"></i></a>
          <a href="https://www.facebook.com/sharer/sharer.php?u=https://jerickevans-gif.github.io/Once-Upon-A-Time/newsletter-article.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Share on Facebook" style="background:var(--snow);border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--ink);width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:8px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-decoration:none"><i class="ph ph-facebook-logo"></i></a>
          <a href="mailto:?subject=OUAT%20December%202025&body=https://jerickevans-gif.github.io/Once-Upon-A-Time/newsletter-article.html" aria-label="Share via email" style="background:var(--snow);border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--ink);width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:8px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-decoration:none"><i class="ph ph-envelope"></i></a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <section class="article-related" aria-labelledby="related-h3">
      <h3 id="related-h3">More from the newsletter</h3>
      <div class="article-related-grid">
        <a href="newsletter-article.html?issue=2025-11" class="nl-card" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit;background:var(--snow);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;display:block">
          <div style="aspect-ratio:16/10;background:linear-gradient(rgba(139,80,68,.4),rgba(139,80,68,.5)),url('once-upon-a-time-assets/landing/ballet-card.jpg') center/cover;background-blend-mode:multiply"></div>
          <div style="padding:18px"><div style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:18px;text-transform:uppercase">November 2025</div><div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-muted);margin-top:4px">Author: Lena Stuart · Nov 18, 2025</div></div>
        </a>
        <a href="newsletter-article.html?issue=2025-10" class="nl-card" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit;background:var(--snow);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;display:block">
          <div style="aspect-ratio:16/10;background:linear-gradient(rgba(107,109,32,.45),rgba(107,109,32,.5)),url('once-upon-a-time-assets/landing/donor-bg.jpg') center/cover;background-blend-mode:multiply"></div>
          <div style="padding:18px"><div style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:18px;text-transform:uppercase">October 2025</div><div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-muted);margin-top:4px">Author: Sydney Phelps · Oct 18, 2025</div></div>
        </a>
        <a href="newsletter.html" class="nl-card" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit;background:var(--snow);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;display:block">
          <div style="aspect-ratio:16/10;background:var(--rose-100);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:var(--rose-700);font-family:var(--serif);font-size:24px">View all <i class="ph ph-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></div>
          <div style="padding:18px"><div style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:18px;text-transform:uppercase">All issues</div><div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-muted);margin-top:4px">Browse the archive</div></div>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

